
#####################################
### R Code Files and their output ###
#####################################

#### grid_country_mapping.R ####
* this code maps NetCDF file grid cells by lat and lon to countries

## outputs 

* grid_country_lookup.csv 
** columns: lon	lat	grid_id	country_name	country_code_iso3	country_code_iso2
** country code assigned to every grid cell

#### NetCDF_extract.R
* this code 1) extracts grid cell data from NetCDF file 2) joins with country mapping
3) creates dataframe and exports as csv

## outputs 

* annual_ave_pm25_2000.csv
** columns: lon	lat	country_name	country_code_iso3	pm25_annual	n_months
** annual PM25 per grid cell, includes all PM (fire plus all other)


